From 7c25d233d263eeeb0ae39f334d0322635f0b127b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Deniz Kokden <koekdendeniz@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 11:52:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 001/109] ARM: sprd: initial bring-up for Samsung Galaxy Tab E
 (SC7730, gtelwifi)

- Kconfig-only ARCH_SPRD for 32-bit scx35/shark SoCs
- clocksource: new driver for the SC8830/SC7730 32-bit AON timer
- dts: sc7730.dtsi + sc7730-samsung-gtelwifi.dts (1 CPU, GIC, timer,
  simple-framebuffer, ramoops)
- bootstripes: debug aid painting boot progress into the bootloader
  framebuffer passed as lcd_base= (no UART needed)

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: Deniz Kokden <koekdendeniz@gmail.com>
---
